              "id": "b5e26dc8-884b-4afc-bd9f-c8007c1198e6",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<strong>Hermann Karl Hesse</strong> (2 July 1877 – 9 August 1962) was a German-Swiss poet, novelist, and painter. His best-known works include <em>Demian, Steppenwolf, Siddhartha, </em>and<em> </em><em><a href=\"#/magister-ludi-the-glass-bead-game\">The Glass Bead Game</a></em>, each of which explores an individual's search for authenticity, self-knowledge and spirituality. In 1946, he received the Nobel Prize in Literature."
            },
